"The comparison proportion can't be equal to the hypothesized proportion with "
"a 'Two-sided' alternative hypothesis."
msgstr ""
"対立仮説が「両側」の場合、比較の割合が仮説の割合と等しくなることはありえませ"
"ん。"

msgid ""
"The comparison proportion has to be less than the hypothesized proportion "
"with an alternative hypothesis of 'Less'."
msgstr ""
"対立仮説が「小さい」の場合、比較する比率は仮説の比率より小さくなければなりま"
"せん。"

msgid ""
"The comparison proportion has to be greater than the hypothesized proportion "
"with an alternative hypothesis of 'Greater'."
msgstr ""
"対立仮説が「大きい」の場合、比較する比率は仮説の比率より大きくなければなりま"
"せん。"

msgid "Invalid alternative."
msgstr "対立仮説が不正です。"

msgid ""
"The comparison proportion can't be equal to the baseline proportion with a "
"'Two-sided' alternative hypothesis."
msgstr ""
"対立仮説が「両側」の場合、比較する比率をベースラインの比率と等しくできません"
"。"

msgid ""
"The comparison proportion has to be less than the baseline proportion with "
"an alternative hypothesis of 'Less'."
msgstr ""
"対立仮説が「小さい」の場合、比較する比率はベースラインの比率より小さくなけれ"
"ばなりません。"

msgid ""
"The comparison proportion has to be greater than the baseline proportion "
"with an alternative hypothesis of 'Greater'."
msgstr ""
"対立仮説が「大きい」の場合、比較する比率はベースラインの比率より大きくなけれ"
"ばなりません。"

msgid ""
"The variance ratio can't be 1 with a 'Two-sided' alternative hypothesis."
msgstr "対立仮説が「両側」の場合、分散比を 1 にできません。"

msgid ""
"The variance ratio has to be less than 1 with an alternative hypothesis "
"'Less'."
msgstr "対立仮説が「小さい」の場合、分散比は 1 より小さくなければなりません。"

msgid ""
"The variance ratio has to be greater than 1 with an alternative hypothesis "
"of 'Greater'."
msgstr "対立仮説が「大きい」の場合、分散比は 1 より大きくなければなりません。"

